Description: Local, offline metadata cleaner and AI-tag remover for images, text/Markdown,
 HTML, and Office documents.
 A local, offline metadata cleaner and AI-tag remover for images
 (JPEG/PNG/WebP/BMP/GIF/TIFF), text/Markdown, HTML, and Office documents
 (DOCX/XLSX/PPTX). Strips EXIF, GPS, XMP, IPTC, C2PA content credentials, and
 AI-generator signatures from images; invisible-Unicode steganography and
 AI-identifying frontmatter/meta tags from text/Markdown/HTML; and
 author/company/tracking properties from Office documents. Includes real AI
 super-resolution upscaling (Real-ESRGAN) and a local drag-and-drop web UI
 (`metaclean serve`). No network calls, no upload — everything runs on your
 machine.

